# backslash-comment-inc: Does a comment backslash on line 1 of an included file swallow line 2 (XPPAUT 8.2.2)?
# xpp: v@3=2
# pc: ODE0076
# ruling: only line 1 of the main file is exempt. In the included file the comment swallows `x'=1`, so `x'=2` below is the only equation; PhaseCont matches and warns (language.md, Lines).
#include inc/bs-comment.ode
x'=2
x(0)=0
aux v=x
@ total=1,dt=0.5,meth=euler
